# Maps the identities git auto-generated before user.name and user.email were set.
# `gregorymoynihan@Mac.lan` is a hostname-derived address, not a real mailbox, so it
# was never linked to the GitHub account. This unifies `git log`, `git shortlog` and
# `git blame` without rewriting history; GitHub's contribution graph reads the commit
# objects themselves and is unaffected.
